00:00:07,619 --> 00:00:09,819
By the end, you'll know what traceability

5
00:00:09,819 --> 00:00:12,186
must link, you'll see how to respond to a

6
00:00:12,186 --> 00:00:14,314
suspected transmission, and you'll

7
00:00:14,314 --> 00:00:16,249
understand why pressure causes most

8
00:00:16,249 --> 00:00:17,050
